 dfdu  /r                                  ⠋ scanning 00:00
 3┏ Keys ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ / search ┓e
  ┃ Navigate                                             ┃
  ┃ ↑ k            move up                               ┃
  ┃ ↓ j            move down                             ┃
  ┃ PgUp           page up                               ┃
  ┃ PgDn           page down                             ┃
  ┃ g Home         first entry                           ┃
  ┃ G End          last entry                            ┃
  ┃ → l Enter      open directory                        ┃
  ┃ ← h Backspace  parent directory                      ┃
  ┃                                                      ┃
  ┃ Sort                                                 ┃
  ┃ s  sort by size (again: reverse)                     ┃
  ┃ n  sort by name (again: reverse)                     ┃
  ┃ C  sort by items (again: reverse)                    ┃
  ┃ M  sort by modification time (again: reverse)        ┃
  ┃ S  re-sort now                                       ┃
  ┃                                                      ┃
  ┃ Display                                              ┃
  ┃ a  toggle apparent size / disk usage                 ┃
  ┃ u  toggle disk usage like du (shared data once per   ┃
  ┃    file)                                             ┃
  ┃ e  hide or show hidden files                         ┃
  ┃                                                      ┃
  ┃ Act                                                  ┃
  ┃ r      rescan the selected directory                 ┃
  ┃ x      skip directories that are not responding      ┃
  ┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ ↓ more ┛
 ↑↓ scroll  PgUp PgDn page  / search  Esc close
